---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service - Ocean Dating App"
  description="Read Ocean’s Terms of Service governing your use of the Ocean dating app."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>Rules and conditions for using Ocean</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
            Last updated: December 2025
          </p>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the Ocean
              mobile application (the “App”), operated by Crystal Dating, Inc.
              (“Crystal Dating,” “Ocean,” “we,” “us,” or “our”).
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              By creating an account or using the App, you agree to be bound by these Terms
              and our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, you may not
              use the App.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">1. Eligibility</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Ocean is intended for use only by individuals who are at least 18 years old
              and located in the United States. You represent and warrant that you are
              18 years of age or older.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We may terminate or delete accounts that we believe belong to users under 18.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">2. Accounts</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Each account is intended for use by an individual. You are responsible for
              maintaining the confidentiality of your account and for all activity that
              occurs under your account.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts at our discretion,
              including for violations of these Terms or our Code of Conduct.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">3. Code of Conduct</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Use of the App is subject to our Code of Conduct, which you must separately
              agree to during account creation. The Code of Conduct forms part of these
              Terms and governs acceptable behavior on and in connection with the App.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Violations of the Code of Conduct may result in warnings, suspension, or
              permanent removal from the App, without notice.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">4. User Content</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              You are responsible for the content you submit, post, or share through the App,
              including profile information, photos, and messages (“User Content”).
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              You retain ownership of your User Content, but you grant us a non-exclusive,
              royalty-free, worldwide license to host, store, display, process, and
              distribute such content as necessary to operate and improve the App.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">5. Messaging and Interactions</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              The App allows users to communicate through private messages. Messages are
              not encrypted end-to-end, and you understand that communications may be
              reviewed if reported.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              You are solely responsible for your interactions with other users, both online
              and offline. We do not conduct background checks and do not guarantee the
              behavior, intentions, or identity of users.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">6. Matching and AI Features</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Ocean uses automated systems, including artificial intelligence, to generate
              compatibility scores, explanations, and to determine which profiles are shown
              to users.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We do not guarantee matches, compatibility, or outcomes. Matching results are
              subjective and may differ between users.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">7. Paid Features</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              The App may offer paid features or subscriptions now or in the future. Pricing,
              billing terms, and cancellation policies will be disclosed at the time of
              purchase and are subject to applicable app store rules.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">8. Termination</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We may suspend or terminate your access to the App at any time for any lawful
              reason, including violations of these Terms or the Code of Conduct.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">9. Disclaimers</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              The App is provided “as is” and “as available” without warranties of any kind.
              We do not guarantee uninterrupted access, error-free operation, or specific
              results from use of the App.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              To the maximum extent permitted by law, Crystal Dating, Inc. shall not be
              liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages
              arising out of or related to your use of the App.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">11. Governing Law</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard
              to conflict-of-law principles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the App after
              changes become effective constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">13. Contact Us</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <strong>Crystal Dating, Inc.</strong><br />
              3229 Greenpoint Ave PMB 107<br />
              Long Island City, NY 11101<br />
              United States<br />
              Email: <a href="mailto:support@oceandating.app">support@oceandating.app</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
